":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"2處獨立位置，2個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete-ws2638629"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"life_events":[{"id":"le-qi058-zhang-mu-death","person_id":"lh7_1sm_5y7","event_type":"death","source_term":"卒","source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p032","start":28,"end":29,"surface":"卒"},"date_expression":"泰始初","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-058","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete-ws2638629","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p032","quote":"交州斗絕海島，控帶外國，故恃險數不賓。宋泰始初，刺史張牧卒，交趾人李長仁殺牧北來部曲，據交州叛，數年病死，從弟叔獻嗣事，號令未行，遣使求刺史。宋朝以南海太守沈煥為交州刺史，以叔獻為煥寧遠司馬、武平新昌二郡太守。叔獻得朝命，人情服從，遂發兵守險不納煥，煥停鬱林病卒。太祖建元元年，仍以叔獻為交州刺史，就安慰之。叔獻受命，既而斷割外國，貢獻寡少。世祖欲討之，永明三年，以司農劉楷為交州刺史，發南康、廬陵、始興郡兵征交州。叔獻聞之，遣使願更申數年，獻十二隊純銀兜鍪及孔雀毦，世祖不許。叔獻懼為楷所襲，間道自湘川還朝。","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p032:m0026"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"按同段人物與次第核所屬卒事。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p032:m0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"張牧","kind":"person","person_id":"lh7_1sm_5y7","status":"contextual_pro